<title>INDIA: India GAIL up 3.0 pct on National bourse.</title>
<headline>India GAIL up 3.0 pct on National bourse.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of state-run Gas Authority of India Ltd (GAIL) jumped 4.55 rupees, or nearly three percent, to 163.05 as investors bought after the firm announced improved results for the year ended March 31, traders said.  </p>
<p>India's largest supplier of natural gas said earlier this week its net profit climbed to 6.19 billion rupees in 1996/97 (April-March), from 5.51 billion in the previous year.</p>
<p>&quot;There's some investor interest in the stock,&quot; said a trader at a foreign brokerage.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
